{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56806","headline":"美少年继作（题拟） · 不详","name":"美少年继作（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乘鸾跨凤下崑仑，正值三星影入门。\n银烛高低攒宝帐，彩牋交互劝瑶尊。\n药灵许向人间说，《易》妙期於象外论。\n休忆当年陪孟德，绕梁争看酒杯翻。\n（同前）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56806.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56806","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}